 <h2 id="sources">Sources and further reading</h2>
 <p>Checked on 20 October 2026. The invented fixtures and reported query results were verified on native PostgreSQL 18.6, with UTC session time zone and C database locale. The seven figures are logical models checked against those results. No other database engine was measured.</p>
 <ul>
  <li>PostgreSQL 18, <a href="https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/tutorial-window.html">Window Functions</a>: input rows, partitions, window order and filtering through a subquery.</li>
