  <li><a href="https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/functions-aggregate.html">Aggregate Functions</a>: SUM and COUNT with missing inputs. <a href="https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/functions-conditional.html">Conditional Expressions</a> defines NULLIF.</li>
  <li>Google BigQuery, <a href="https://docs.cloud.google.com/bigquery/docs/reference/standard-sql/query-syntax#qualify_clause">QUALIFY clause</a>: an alternative spelling for filtering window results in that dialect.</li>
